<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: We live only to vore others.-->
  <RV2_Predation.description>我们活着只是为了吃人其他人。</RV2_Predation.description>
  <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)        ->[deity0_name] went to [deity0_possessive] brother and shoved him down [deity0_possessive] gullet, gaining the power to become the first of gods.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.0>creation(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)->[deity0_name]前往[deity0_possessive]兄弟将他推倒[deity0_possessive]吞食，获得力量成为神的第一。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.0>
  <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_RV2_Predation)  ->The [deity0_type] [deity0_name] ate [deity0_possessive] enemies whole.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.1>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 这个[deity0_type][deity0_name]吃了[deity0_possessive]敌人全部。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.1>
  <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)              ->the weak are to be food for the strong-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.10>lesson(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 弱者将成为强者的食物</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.10>
  <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)              ->anyone opposing our divine right to consume our prey must be subdued-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.11>lesson(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 任何反对我们吞噬猎物的神圣权利的人都必须被压制</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.11>
  <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_RV2_Predation) ->Before we accept new members, we must make sure they understand this.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.12>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 在我们接受新成员之前，我们必须确保他们明白这一点。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.12>
  <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)    ->The only explanation for the archotech god-machines strength and virility is that they vored their lessers and gained immeasurable power.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.13>archistBasis(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 超凡智能神-机器的力量和贞洁的唯一解释是，他们掠夺了他们的破坏者，并获得了不可估量的力量。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.13>
  <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)     ->As the consciousness of an archotech expands, it must grow its substrate by consuming and merging with other machines.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.14>archistFact(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 随着超凡智能的意识扩大，它必须通过消耗并与其他机器融合来种植它的基底。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.14>
  <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_RV2_Predation) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will finish their final phase of growth by consuming and merging with all of humanity.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.15>archistProphecy(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)->[inTheEnd],超凡智能将通过吞噬并与全人类融合来完成他们成长的最后阶段。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.15>
  <!--EN: animistBasis(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)    ->Spirits infuse all objects around us, and we can absorb these spirits by eating them. There are no spirits as powerful as the ones that inhabit living things.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.16>animistBasis(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 灵质注入我们周围的所有物体，我们可以通过食用它们来吸收这些灵质。没有比居住在生物体内的灵更强大的了。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.16>
  <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)     ->We can absorb the spirit and power of others by consuming them.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.17>animistFact(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 我们可以通过消耗他人的精神和力量来汲取它们。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.17>
  <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], there was a human named [deity0_name]. After conflicts broke out, [deity0_name] began [deity0_possessive] quest of voring any enemies opposing [deity0_name] and became the [deity0_type].-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.2>intro(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 在[place_summary][place_name],有一个人叫[deity0_name]。在冲突爆发后,[deity0_name]开始[deity0_possessive]V见敌人[deity0_name]并成为[deity0_type]。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.2>
  <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], during the [ritualName], [deity0_name] came down into the [altarRoomLabel] to vore the given sacrifice in front of the [memberNamePlural].-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.3>intro(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 在[place_summary][place_name],在[ritualName],[deity0_name]进入[altarRoomLabel]到吃人在被给予的祭品面前[memberNamePlural]。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.3>
  <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)        ->A [foeLeader] declared that all who vore others were criminals, and sent [foeSoldiers] to persecute the [memberNamePlural].-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.4>conflict(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> A[foeLeader]宣布所有吃人其他人是罪犯，并派[foeSoldiers]迫害[memberNamePlural]。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.4>
  <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)     ->A [place_job] named [founderName] was attacked by one of the [foeLeader]'s [foeSoldiers]. [founderName] wounded [foeLeader_objective] with a [place_personalWeapon] and vored the defenseless leader. Doing so [deity0_name] gained [deity0_possessive] strength.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.5>founderJoin(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> A[place_job]已命名[founderName]被其中一名袭击了[foeLeader]的[foeSoldiers]。[founderName]受伤[foeLeader_objective]带一个[place_personalWeapon]背叛了那个毫无防备的首领。这么做[deity0_name]获得[deity0_possessive]力量。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.5>
  <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)         ->[founderName] led a group of [memberNamePlural] into the [place_powerCenter], killed the [foeLeader] and many of [foeLeader_possessive] soldiers, voring any surviving foes. [deity0_name] made [founderName] into the new [foeLeader].-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.6>victory(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)->[founderName]带领一群[memberNamePlural]进入[place_powerCenter],杀死了[foeLeader]和许多[foeLeader_possessive]士兵们，驱赶任何幸存的敌人。[deity0_name]制作[founderName]进入新的[foeLeader]。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.6>
  <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)           ->[founderName] crashlanded on a distant world. Lacking food and surrounded by useless companions, [founder_pronoun] feasted, and became strong.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.7>setup(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)->[founderName]坠毁在一个遥远的世界。缺少食物，被无用的同伴包围,[founder_pronoun]盛宴，变得强大。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.7>
  <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_RV2_Predation)    ->To consecrate their commitment, [founderName] demanded that believers consume proper prey at least once a week.-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.8>story(uses=1,tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 为了奉献他们的承诺,[founderName]被要求信徒每周至少食用一次合适的猎物。</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.8>
  <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)         ->The most important lesson to learn as a divine predator:-->
  <RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.9>lessonIntro(tag=meme_RV2_Predation)-> 作为神圣的捕食者，需要学习的最重要的一课:</RV2_Predation.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.9>
